<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Health raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Health raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Integrated Health Services Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said kept the long-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
